{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "action-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1800,
      "height": 150,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# 动作曲线｜原Montage XYZ与明确Profile模式\n原Task／Main→End来源 → CMC同一RMS／native时间 → 胶囊物理；作者点授权、混出、Task完成与贡献消费分别认证。\n[[Movement/动作曲线执行|契约与证据]] · [[Movement/结构]] · [[Movement/GGYGO_流程_移动与位移.canvas|主流程]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-author",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 原资产与离线业务生产\nPyrios原Sequence含累计RootMotion_PosX/Y/Z；Animation依原Montage／FullBody建立完整Main→End绑定。\nMontage作者单点Name=Event.Montage.CancelPoint；完整End与末帧混出／独立时长归资产，原Sequence保留。\nKevin离线业务生产保持独立模式；原曲线唯一来源，缺失明确拒绝。"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-profile",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 490,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 原SourceBinding／业务Profile\n当前普攻：原Montage／Slot／有序Sections／Segments；Task给原实例／位置／固定速率。\nMapMontageInterval逐源／loop差分PosXYZ；私有native末端量化认证完整源末帧，raw身份不变。\nnative动画RootMotion互斥；业务Profile另配CV／Duration／Scale，地面XY，无错误替代。"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-ga",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## GA／原Task编排\nGA持原Activation／StepToken／Task／Handle，Main→End同一轨迹。\n原Task Point事实 → HandleMontageNotify → EnableStepInterruption；新播放关门。\n过点QueryQualifiedMovementIntent／SubscribeQualifiedMovementIntent原Scope；Held／新Press须合格，原Handle不换。\n移动精确取消后结束GA／重置；新攻击由GA接续，Section不授门。\n自然等TaskCompleted＋MotionCompleted；必需Pose失效中止。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构]] · [[Animation/结构]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-begin",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 490,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## CMC::BeginMontageActionMotion\n原Source／Instance／当前Section位置／Rate／Scale → 核身份／范围／互斥／有限值 → 原Handle或失败。\nauthority或原本地autonomous，Walking／NavWalking／Falling。\n捕获Actor基准与MeshScale×业务Scale一次，退自身Stop／TurnBack，挂同一Action RMS。\nMain→End不换资源；End校正启动读取当前原位置。Profile另为明确地面XY。"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-sample",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 990,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## native RMS PrepareRootMotion\n实际sim／tick＋同一native时间映射Main→End的原Sequence分片，累计PosXYZ逐源／loop差分。\n固定Actor基准×捕获Scale → WorldDelta／tick → Override XYZ。\n零位移持有；最后区间标bPreparedNaturalEnd，不在Prepare宣告消费完成。\nnative Walking／NavWalking／Falling继续胶囊碰撞／重力／落地。"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-clean",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1490,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "## 打断／失败／精确释放\nGA作者点后QueryQualifiedMovementIntent／原Scope订阅；合格Held／新Press → CancelMontageActionMotionForMovement → 原输入WalkRun。\nGA结束／重置连段，新播放关门；CMC不持攻击门／段政策。\n自然：TaskCompleted＋MotionCompleted → RequestAbilityEnd。\nCompleted有界收据；其他理由中和原贡献、撤原回调。\nGA先脱资源再退原Observer／Handle／Task／Trace，保空气Z／后继。"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-scope",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 490,
      "y": 1050,
      "width": 1410,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## 实际验证与剩余边界\n完成须同一Activation／StepToken／Task／Handle／Source；OwnerSync输入Scope不是动作ID。\nactive Montage=None、BlendOut或Release成功不代表胶囊最后贡献已消费。\nNotifyNatural在消费完成前核原live实例；瞬时移除实例的其他混出配置须明确兼容。\nPose只修身体余量；胶囊执行与鞋底几何分别验收，碰撞不走追补链。\n[[Movement/计划_移动与动作位移|实际验收／历史失败／未验范围]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-native-task-facts",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原Task：混出与播放完成\n原非Interrupted OnBlendOut → NotifyMontageActionNaturalBlendOut(原Handle,InstanceId)。\nCMC核配置末段auto-blend窗口；原native尾区间继续，不通知MotionCompleted。\n原OnCompleted → ReleaseMontageActionMotion(原Handle,Completed)，仅接受有界Drain。\nGA记TaskCompleted，等待原MotionCompleted；原Interrupted／Cancelled精确中止。\n混出触发与时长读Montage配置，无额外播放时钟。",
      "x": -205,
      "y": 1580,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "action-native-consumed-final",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## CMC：最后贡献消费完成\nApplyRootMotionToVelocity → Super原生应用Prepared贡献；标bPreparedContributionConsumed。\nnative胶囊物理／碰撞完成 → UpdateCharacterStateAfterMovement。\nPublishMontageActionMotionCompletion核原资源、natural-end／consumed且非cancel；不在历史回放发布。\n先脱原接收者，再回传精确原Handle；GA Observe回调记MotionCompleted。\n原TaskCompleted是另一事实；自然完成不借后继或补执行器。",
      "x": 2760,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 430,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
